OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to help dementia patients
OL,4,A'trapped' in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestaurant-style buzzers could be used
OL,7,Fto stop dementia patients becoming
OL,8,F"trapped" in A&E.
OL,10,FRugby-based dementia nurse Victoria
OL,11,FMcGrath developed the pilot scheme,
OL,12,Fwhich would allow patients to leave
OL,13,Fwaiting rooms with their carer and
OL,14,Freturn when called.
OL,16,FShe hopes the trial for 'Wait Well'
OL,17,Fwill begin at University Hospital
OL,18,FCoventry (UHCW), with the long-term aim
OL,19,Fof rolling it out across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
